.. rubric:: Green User LED Blinky by GPIO

See also Zephyr sample: :external+zephyr:zephyr:code-sample:`blinky`.

   .. rubric:: On ``4㎆`` revision (default)

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/basic/blinky
      :build-dir: waveshare_rp2040
      :board: waveshare_rp2040_plus@4mb
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

   .. rubric:: On ``16㎆`` revision

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/basic/blinky
      :build-dir: waveshare_rp2040
      :board: waveshare_rp2040_plus@16mb
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

